DESCRIPTION:Agincourt Garden Club Plant\, Veggie + Gently Used Treasures Sale!!! \nSaturday May 23/26 9-12 \nKnox United Christian Education Center\, 2575 Midland @ Sheppard\, driveway and bus stop off of Rural Ave. \nMembers bring plants they have grown themselves so they can tell you the care tips etc. Outside: House plants\, perennial plants that come back every year\, annual plants\, veggies are outside. \nRain or shine \nInside: Gently used goods \nCash Only – but your cash will go a lot farther than at Big Box Stores. \nWe would love to see you\, your friends and family get your garden set up with our selection! \nThis garden club is for new\, novice\, regular and expert gardeners. FYI: cheryl.penner@hotmail.com \nFacebook:   Agincourt Garden Club \nInstagram:  AGC Agincourt Garden Club \ncheryl.penner@hotmail.com
